#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:7
msgid "Display conductor properties"
msgstr "显示导体属性"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:9
msgid ""
"The conductor properties window can be displayed from `menu bar`_, from "
"`workspace`_ and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "导电器属性窗口可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 显示，从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 并使用相应的键盘快捷键显示。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:13
msgid "Display conductor properties from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏显示导体属性"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:15
#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:39
msgid "Select the `conductor`_ which `properties`_ should be displayed."
msgstr "选择 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 哪个 `属性 <properties_>`_ 应显示。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:16
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit conductor** menu item to display the conductor "
"properties PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 编辑导线** 菜单项以显示导线属性 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:24
msgid "Display conductor properties from workspace"
msgstr "从工作空间显示导体属性"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:26
msgid ""
"Right click on the `conductor`_ which `properties`_ should be displayed."
msgstr "右键点击 `导体 <conductor_>`_，该导体应显示 `属性 <properties_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:27
msgid ""
"Select **Edit conductor** option to display the conductor properties PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "选择 **编辑导线** 选项以显示导线属性弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:32
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech conductor options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech导电选项"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:35
msgid "Display conductor properties using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键显示导电器属性"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:37
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:40
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the conductor properties PopUp window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示导体属性 PopUp 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/display_conductor_properties.rst:44
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
